# Static abilities go too (CR 613.1f): with Thalia, Guardian of Thraben out, Eaten by Piranhas costs {2}{U} (noncreature
# spells cost {1} more), so Bot1 taps all three Moxen for it and nothing is left in the pool. Once it resolves Thalia has lost
# first strike and the tax: Bot1's next noncreature spell, a Mox Jet, is cast for its plain {0} with nothing to pay it with.
# Thalia is 1/1 black Skeleton.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Eaten by Piranhas
Mox Jet
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Thalia, Guardian of Thraben
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Thalia, Guardian of Thraben.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Thalia, Guardian of Thraben.Keywords = FirstStrike
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Eaten by Piranhas.Cast(Thalia, Guardian of Thraben)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Thalia, Guardian of Thraben.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Tapped = false
Bot2.Battlefield.Thalia, Guardian of Thraben.Power = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Thalia, Guardian of Thraben.Toughness = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Thalia, Guardian of Thraben.Supertypes = Legendary
